ties created by law, including by prohibiting such entities from spending money to influence elections.</p>","updateDate":"2026-04-01T01:19:36Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Proposing an amendment to the Constitution of the United States relating to contributions and expenditures intended to affect elections.","type":"hjres","updateDate":"2026-07-22T08:08:32Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-30T16:27:18Z"}
